 "tick_rate_evidence": "Every traced routine fires once per two emulator frames. ENTITY_TICK 671331 gaps of 2 against 6100 of 1; PLAYER_TICK 40763 against 220; also TURRET_TICK, GRAPPLE_TICK, LEVER_TICK and ANIM_TICK. The DS renders at 60Hz but simulates at 30Hz, so every per-frame constant is per 30Hz tick.",
